    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33573" root="فرض" body-key="f">
    
      8 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">افترضهُ</span></b> : see 1, first sentence. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَمْ يَفْتَرِضْهَا</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَلَدٌ</span>, occurring in a trad., means [<i>A child had not
been brought forth by her;</i> lit.] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَمْ يَحُزَّهَا</span>, and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَمْ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يُوءَتِّرْهَا</span> [a mistake for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لم يُوءَشِّرْهَا</span>]. (TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  See
also 1, latter part of the first half of the paragraph. ＝ 
 
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">افترض الجُنْدٌ</span> <i>The soldiers received their
stipends.</i> (A, K.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A4-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">افترض القَوْمُ</span> <i>The people,</i>
or <i>company of men, perished, none of them remaining;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">انقرض</span>. (K.)

